<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">Three years ago Th=
e Sunday Times, The Times and Channel 4 published an investigation into the=
 alleged criminal behaviour of Russell Brand. Last week a jury returned ver=
dicts of guilty on one charge of rape and three of sexual assault. Brand wi=
