dio and on television about his appalling treatment of women, able to escap=
e any investigation for so long? Today Rosamund Urwin, our chief news corre=
spondent who has investigated Brand for seven years,&nbsp;<a href=3D"https:=
//link.thetimes.com/click/6aefacce7307c5c1ac0bc564/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGlt=
