coration: underline; color: #006699;">sets out the tactics that he used</a>=
&nbsp;to such potent effect to silence anyone who dared question his behavi=
our. The cast list includes agents, broadcast bosses and lawyers. It is a r=
eminder of how far the rich and powerful will go to protect their reputatio=
ns.&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://link.thetimes.com/click/6aefacce7307c5c1ac0bc56=
4/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL2NvbW1lbnQvY29sdW1uaXN0cy9hcnRpY2xlL3J1c=
