t-decoration: underline; color: #006699;">Camilla Long was in court</a>&nbs=
p;for a crucial day of the trial.</span>
</p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p=
><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px">
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">The political eart=
hquake of the week was in America as voters rejected Donald Trump=E2=80=99s=
 Republicans in their millions. Trump has responded by appointing long-time=
